<title>KUWAIT: Iran's oil minister to visit Kuwait Sunday.</title>
<headline>Iran's oil minister to visit Kuwait Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran's Oil Minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh will start an official visit to Kuwait on Sunday, an Iranian diplomat said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Ahgazadeh's two-day visit to the Gulf Arab state comes in response to an invitation by his counterpart Isa al-Mazeedi, the diplomat told Reuters without elaboration.</p>
<p>The visit is the first by Aghazadeh to Kuwait since the 1991 Gulf War.</p>
</text>
